<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>The Battle of Chiapas, 2020</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;This scenario assumes tensions between Mexico and Guatemala have increased.&amp;nbsp; Guatemala claims that Mexico has committed flagrant violations of its air space and its fisheries.&amp;nbsp; Despite the fact that Mexico is a much larger country, limited forces are available to watch its southern border.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;It is feared that Guatemala may take advantage of this situation to conduct "retaliatory" raids into Mexican territory.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
